-- M1 第二块 PR4：出站控制（白名单、出站日志）。已有模型上游的主机由程序在首次启动时迁移进白名单并记审计。
-- Create "egress_logs" table
CREATE TABLE "egress_logs" ("id" bigint NOT NULL GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY, "ts" timestamptz NOT NULL, "user_id" bigint NULL, "actor_email" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "module" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "method" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "scheme" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "host" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "port" bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, "path" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "ip" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "decision" character varying NOT NULL, "reason" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "status" bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, "duration_ms" bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, "bytes_out" bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, "bytes_in" bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, "error" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', PRIMARY KEY ("id"));
-- Create index "egresslog_ts" to table: "egress_logs"
CREATE INDEX "egresslog_ts" ON "egress_logs" ("ts");
-- Create index "egresslog_decision_ts" to table: "egress_logs"
CREATE INDEX "egresslog_decision_ts" ON "egress_logs" ("decision", "ts");
-- Create index "egresslog_host_ts" to table: "egress_logs"
CREATE INDEX "egresslog_host_ts" ON "egress_logs" ("host", "ts");
-- Create "egress_rules" table
CREATE TABLE "egress_rules" ("id" bigint NOT NULL GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY, "created_at" timestamptz NOT NULL, "updated_at" timestamptz NOT NULL, "kind" character varying NOT NULL, "value" character varying NOT NULL, "ports" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "note" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT '', "source" character varying NOT NULL DEFAULT 'manual', "private" boolean NOT NULL DEFAULT false, "created_by" bigint NULL, PRIMARY KEY ("id"));
-- Create index "egressrule_kind_value_ports" to table: "egress_rules"
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "egressrule_kind_value_ports" ON "egress_rules" ("kind", "value", "ports");
-- 出站日志只追加：禁止修改（保留期清理留给维护任务）。
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION hengdesk_egress_log_immutable() RETURNS trigger AS $$
BEGIN
  RAISE EXCEPTION 'egress_logs is append-only';
END;
$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;
CREATE TRIGGER egress_logs_no_update BEFORE UPDATE ON egress_logs
  FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION hengdesk_egress_log_immutable();
